{"results":[{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000076","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"Raygun is explicitly described as an auto-encoder with decoder-side generation and generative sampling. It is also pretrained on ~80,000 UniRef50 proteins and used for broad sequence modification tasks.","evidence_snippet":"\"auto-encoder\"; \"support generative sampling\"; \"trained on around 80,000 proteins from UniRef50\"; \"single-shot generation\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000082","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"Unify is presented as a transfer learning framework for universal cell embeddings and cross-species prediction, not a generative architecture. The evidence supports broad transferable representations but not generation.","evidence_snippet":"\"learns universal cell embeddings\"; \"transfer learning methodology\"; \"combining RNA expression with embeddings\"; \"prediction of perturbation responses across species\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000106","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"generative_status_unclear","decision_rationale":"scMIR is a pretrained vision-language foundation model with strong transferable representations, but the provided sections only show self-supervised image reconstruction and text-guided alignment. They do not clearly establish a genuinely generative text-bio mechanism.","evidence_snippet":"\"self-supervised image reconstruction with text-guided cross-modal alignment\"; \"pretrained on 207,957 image-text pairs\"; \"task-agnostic image embeddings\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000131","paper_type":"application_wrapper","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"CellDuality fine-tunes and steers an existing LLM for biological reasoning with SFT and self-supervised RLVR, so the contribution is an application wrapper rather than a new foundational model. The record does show autoregressive text generation, but not candidate-model foundation pretraining.","evidence_snippet":"\"output is a textual response y, generated autoregressively according to the policy\"; \"leveraging powerful teacher models\"; \"Supervised Fine-Tuning\"; \"RLVR\""}]}
